      "name": "Bonecrunching Bite",
      "actions": null,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>A creature that is critically hit by a hyaenodon must succeed at a DC 20 Fortitude Saving Throw save or become Wounded 1 as the creature's bones or cartilage are crushed by the beast's jaws.</p>",
